OurAirports
-----------

TaxiNow uses the OurAirports airport and runway CSV datasets. OurAirports
publishes its downloadable data as public domain.
https://ourairports.com/data/

X-Plane Scenery Gateway
-----------------------

When OpenStreetMap detail is unavailable, the map downloader can obtain airport
layout data from the X-Plane Scenery Gateway.
https://gateway.x-plane.com/
